      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Introduces the WHO Classification of Digital Health Interventions v1.0 as a shared taxonomy anchored on discrete digital health functionalities, and presents the full visual overview of interventions grouped across four primary user categories: 1.0 Clients, 2.0 Healthcare Providers, 3.0 Health System Managers, and 4.0 Data Services.",
