        "text": "Explains why the classification was created (four primary use cases bridging public health and technical communities where frameworks like COBIT, HL7, and ISO are too specialized) and how Digital Health Interventions (DHIs) link to Health System Challenges (HSCs), System Categories (such as LMIS and EMR), synonyms, and programmatic examples.",
